BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[PNW] Aug 18\, 2026: Indy Vet To Vet Terrific Tuesday
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260818T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260818T020000
DTSTAMP:20260814T155459Z
UID:67d6db73c5fb419cd0a3@psc-calendar
CATEGORIES:IN,Other,PNW
DESCRIPTION:Commission: Indiana Utility Regulatory Commission (IN)\nType: 
 Other\nTickers: PNW\n\nCome be part of our Vet to Vet family in the ballro
 om at Pinnacle West. Coffee and snacks will be provided for all veterans i
 n attendance. We’re grateful for the strong community at Pinnacle West a
 nd would be honored to have you with us. We always show up\, no matter wha
 t. Consistency is key! For questions or more information\, contact us at 3
 17‑737‑6927 or visit indyvettovet.org. We never cancel! Consistency is
  key! https://indyvettovet.org https://www.facebook.com/Indyvettovet/ View
  on site | Email this event\n\nSource: https://events.in.gov/event/indy-ve
 t-to-vet-terrific-tuesday
PRIORITY:9
URL:https://events.in.gov/event/indy-vet-to-vet-terrific-tuesday
END:VEVENT
